+        "- Add a same-checkpoint interaction knockout receipt. `FULL` versus separately trained `DROP_C3` is a source-ablation estimand, not the exact same-score contribution measured here.",
+        "- Make the reported endpoint explicitly serialize per-user demand-capped bits alongside uncapped diagnostic bits; the existing pilot summary pools `profile.bits` without this requested reporting cap.",
